<title>HONG KONG: HK land auction - bidding begins for Stanley site.</title>
<headline>HK land auction - bidding begins for Stanley site.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bidding for a 571,848 square foot site in beachside Stanley on southern Hong Kong island began on Tuesday at HK$5.2 billion.</p>
<p>The site, which is being sold at the Hong Kong government's last land auction before the territory is handed back to China, is expected to fetch between HK$6.4 billion and HK$7.3 billion, analysts said.</p>
<p>Hong Kong returns to Chinese rule on midnight of June 30.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
